</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Thou know’st the pain of every scar,</l><l>And lonesome thoughts that come withal,</l><l>But know them not just from afar:</l><l>My heart’s true Friend, come bear them all!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If in my side a thorn must be,</l><l>If in my heart enduring pain,</l><l>Then may Thy peace be balm to me</l><l>And grace my weakness still sustain.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>My vessel broken past repair</l><l>I bring Thee now, O Potter mine.</l><l>Fill with Thyself the breaches there—</l><l>Refashion me with life divine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
